WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:06.850
Amy looked in the mirror.

2
00:00:07.651 --> 00:00:08.691
She needed a haircut.

3
00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:10.992
Her bangs covered her eyes.

4
00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:14.614
Amy was going to meet her friends in one hour.

5
00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.455
They were going to watch a movie.

6
00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:22.197
The more Amy looked at her hair, the more she wanted to cut it.

7
00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:25.138
Then Amy got an idea.

8
00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:29.780
"I know what I'll do," Amy said aloud.

9
00:00:30.528 --> 00:00:32.369
"I'll cut it myself.

10
00:00:33.109 --> 00:00:35.770
After all how hard can it be?"

11
00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:40.392
First, Amy took some scissors out of the drawer.

12
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.513
Next, she wet her hair.

13
00:00:45.074 --> 00:00:47.075
Then, Amy combed her bangs straight.

14
00:00:48.455 --> 00:00:49.336
She began to cut.

15
00:00:50.997 --> 00:00:51.897
Snip. Snip.

16
00:00:52.197 --> 00:00:56.199
Snip. Amy opened her right eye.

17
00:00:57.699 --> 00:00:59.020
It was looking good so far.

18
00:01:01.128 --> 00:01:03.309
Amy continued to cut the rest of her bangs.

19
00:01:04.949 --> 00:01:05.889
Snip. Snip.

20
00:01:06.189 --> 00:01:11.271
Snip. Amy stood back and looked at herself.

21
00:01:12.671 --> 00:01:14.752
She noticed a few strands weren't even.

22
00:01:16.592 --> 00:01:20.633
So she placed her left hand on her forehead and pushed the hair down.

23
00:01:22.494 --> 00:01:23.494
Snip. Snip.

24
00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:28.755
Snip. Amy let go of her left hand.

25
00:01:29.796 --> 00:01:30.896
Her bangs sprang up.

26
00:01:34.528 --> 00:01:35.348
"Argh!" Amy screamed.

27
00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.989
Amy's bangs were much higher than her eyebrows now.

28
00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:41.150
She looked quite ridiculous.

29
00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:46.852
Amy looked at her watch.

30
00:01:48.212 --> 00:01:49.792
She still had time to fix her hair.

31
00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:54.134
Amy squeezed some hair gel onto her hands.

32
00:01:55.754 --> 00:01:57.155
Then she put it on her hair.

33
00:01:57.175 --> 00:02:01.576
"Argh!" Amy screamed.

34
00:02:02.428 --> 00:02:04.950
Now her hair looked like it had been struck by lightning.

35
00:02:07.191 --> 00:02:08.572
Amy was running out of time.

36
00:02:08.592 --> 00:02:13.154
"Oh! Why did I cut my own hair!"

37
00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:14.435
she moaned.

38
00:02:15.415 --> 00:02:16.536
Amy ran to her room.

39
00:02:17.857 --> 00:02:20.939
She pulled out a colorful scarf and wrapped it around her head.

40
00:02:21.899 --> 00:02:23.440
Now she looked like a fortune-teller.

41
00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:27.362
Amy pulled out a box from her closet.

42
00:02:28.463 --> 00:02:30.204
She took out a hat with a large feather.

43
00:02:31.492 --> 00:02:32.973
Now she looked like her grandmother.

44
00:02:34.755 --> 00:02:36.036
Amy pulled out another hat.

45
00:02:36.997 --> 00:02:38.738
She put it on and ran out of the house.

46
00:02:44.383 --> 00:02:46.825
Amy! Why are you wearing that hat?"

47
00:02:47.505 --> 00:02:48.126
asked Lisa.

48
00:02:48.146 --> 00:02:54.912
"Oh, I I felt cold lied Amy.

49
00:02:54.932 --> 00:02:58.475
"Then why are you wearing shorts?"

50
00:02:59.395 --> 00:02:59.976
asked Sherry.

51
00:03:01.128 --> 00:03:03.970
"Hey, the movie's going to start!"

52
00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:05.190
said Amy.

53
00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:11.274
"If you're hot, Amy, you should take your hat off," whispered Sherry.

54
00:03:11.294 --> 00:03:14.235
"I'm fine!"

55
00:03:16.116 --> 00:03:17.037
Amy whispered back.

56
00:03:17.057 --> 00:03:23.400
"Hey, your hat is blocking my view," said a boy.

57
00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:26.602
"Would you mind taking it off please?"

58
00:03:28.463 --> 00:03:31.881
Amy didn't want her friends to see her haircut, but she had no choice.

59
00:03:33.562 --> 00:03:34.923
She slowly took the hat off.

60
00:03:34.943 --> 00:03:41.708
"Whew!" Amy sat back in her seat, relieved.

61
00:03:42.549 --> 00:03:45.411
Since the theater was so dark, no one could see her hair.

62
00:03:51.035 --> 00:03:53.937
go get some ice cream," said Lisa.

63
00:03:53.957 --> 00:03:56.739
"Will you please take that hat off?"

64
00:03:57.439 --> 00:03:58.000
asked Sherry.

65
00:03:59.132 --> 00:04:01.194
Amy pulled her hat tighter over her head.

66
00:04:01.214 --> 00:04:06.558
"The last one to the ice-cream shop is a rotten egg!"

67
00:04:07.259 --> 00:04:10.261
Lisa and Sherry shrugged their shoulders and ran after Amy.

68
00:04:10.281 --> 00:04:13.904
"Hello, girls!

69
00:04:14.385 --> 00:04:15.806
Lovely day, isn't it?"

70
00:04:16.266 --> 00:04:17.047
called out Mrs.

71
00:04:17.107 --> 00:04:19.829
James. "Hello, Mrs.

72
00:04:19.889 --> 00:04:22.191
James! Hello, Oscar!"

73
00:04:23.592 --> 00:04:25.334
Oscar was so happy to see the girls.

74
00:04:26.155 --> 00:04:27.576
The girls bent down to pet him.

75
00:04:29.924 --> 00:04:31.625
Oscar began to sniff Amy's hat.

76
00:04:31.645 --> 00:04:35.528
"No, Oscar, good doggie.

77
00:04:36.229 --> 00:04:37.289
Stop it, Oscar!"

78
00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.451
Amy dropped her ice cream.

79
00:04:39.471 --> 00:04:43.273
"Oh, my ice cream!"

80
00:04:43.914 --> 00:04:44.494
cried Amy.

81
00:04:45.655 --> 00:04:48.717
Oscar pulled the hat right off Amy's head and ran off.

82
00:04:49.618 --> 00:04:52.520
Amy put her hands on her head and tried to cover her hair.

83
00:05:00.236 --> 00:05:00.676
"Amy! Your hair!"

84
00:05:00.696 --> 00:05:01.717
screamed Lisa and Sherry.

85
00:05:02.878 --> 00:05:04.339
Amy slowly lowered her hands.

86
00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:06.701
It was too late!

87
00:05:07.921 --> 00:05:09.262
Her friends saw her haircut.

88
00:05:11.904 --> 00:05:12.825
"What happened?"

89
00:05:13.926 --> 00:05:14.586
asked Lisa.

90
00:05:14.606 --> 00:05:20.810
"I wanted to cut my own hair Amy began.

91
00:05:24.033 --> 00:05:28.496
Amy realized how funny she must have looked wearing the winter hat in the middle of summer.

92
00:05:30.076 --> 00:05:32.317
Suddenly the three girls burst out laughing.

93
00:05:33.037 --> 00:05:34.158
They laughed and laughed.

94
00:05:38.419 --> 00:05:40.740
but what am I going to do?

95
00:05:41.201 --> 00:05:43.762
My hair looks terrible!"

96
00:05:44.482 --> 00:05:45.022
said Amy.

97
00:05:45.042 --> 00:05:49.084
"I have an idea," said Sherry.

98
00:05:50.524 --> 00:05:52.325
She took out two pins from her hair.

99
00:05:52.345 --> 00:05:56.267
"There. How does that look?"

100
00:05:56.287 --> 00:05:58.888
"Oh, you look cute!

101
00:05:59.936 --> 00:06:01.917
I kind of like your haircut!"

102
00:06:02.438 --> 00:06:03.098
said Lisa.

103
00:06:04.599 --> 00:06:05.639
Amy looked in a mirror.

104
00:06:05.659 --> 00:06:10.182
"Oh, I do look kind of cute!"

105
00:06:10.902 --> 00:06:11.402
said Amy.

106
00:06:12.223 --> 00:06:13.583
The three girls laughed again.

107
00:06:13.603 --> 00:06:17.165
"Did you have a good time?"

108
00:06:17.686 --> 00:06:18.226
asked Mother.

109
00:06:18.246 --> 00:06:21.528
"Yes, we had fun."

110
00:06:21.548 --> 00:06:26.971
"Good. Oh, Amy, I noticed your hair was getting long.

111
00:06:27.671 --> 00:06:29.252
I think you need a haircut."
